{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","chunk_index":2,"job_id":"mwjob_ca1eb8feb6baceb8d4fb9eb7","precondition_digest":"db10dd72ce67bd844e06b3dcc432ecba426e9ae405fcfe31cd698c3866db6cf2","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v1","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cc81ab6b8717128e","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db5f25e7dd5b8877","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1741b1557c67abd7","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7de17e9668663cc","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_57a2ea891245f09c","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_a72266096758d298","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_818d6b6aa87464a2"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","evidence_span_ids":["sd_8","sd_9","ps_sec31"],"heading":"研究目的和终点","proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的III期确证性临床研究，受试人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者。研究目的和终点围绕合成试验药A相较匹配安慰剂的疗效与安全性进行设定。主要目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效，主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。次要目的为评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响，相应终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例、第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例、第16周PASI评分较基线的变化以及第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。终点评价时间与访视安排一致，PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中的主要目的、次要目的、主要终点、关键次要终点、其他次要终点、安全性终点及访视评价时点，结合章节包中第3章标题形成总述。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cc81ab6b8717128e","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","evidence_span_ids":["ps_sec31","sd_8","sd_10","sd_12"],"heading":"主要目的和主要终点","proposal_text":"主要目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。主要终点的定义是第16周达到PASI 75应答的受试者比例，PASI 75应答指较基线PASI评分改善≥75%。该终点在第16周进行评价，用于比较试验组与匹配安慰剂组之间的应答率差异。研究的估计目标针对治疗策略人群，即所有随机受试者；停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补，并报告组间率差及95%置信区间。主要终点采用全分析集按随机分组进行分析，以优效性为目标。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中主要目的、主要终点、估计目标策略和统计分析策略，结合章节包中3.1既有正文形成完整正文。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db5f25e7dd5b8877","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","evidence_span_ids":["ps_sec33","sd_8"],"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","proposal_text":"根据当前已确认的研究定义，研究目的分为主要目的和次要目的两类，主要评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效，次要评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响；研究终点包括主要终点、关键次要终点、其他次要终点和安全性终点。当前已确认事实未列出独立的探索性目的或探索性终点，因此本节不新增未经验证的探索性分析或终点定义。本节表述严格限定于已确认的目的与终点范围。","rationale":"章节包显示3.3探索性目的和探索性终点当前为空，当前项目研究定义亦未列出探索性目的或探索性终点，故仅作基于已确认范围的事实性限定表述。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","evidence_span_ids":["sd_1","sd_2","sd_4","sd_6","sd_7","sd_9","sd_11"],"heading":"研究设计","proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的III期、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心确证性临床研究。目标人群为确诊为斑块状银屑病且疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者，入选要求包括年龄≥18岁、确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月，筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，并适合接受系统治疗或光疗。研究设置筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周和安全性随访期4周。试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂，每日一次口服，第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配。计划入组132例，每组66例。筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中研究分期、总体设计、目标人群、入选标准、试验干预、研究时期、访视策略和样本量策略形成第4章总体设计正文。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1741b1557c67abd7","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","evidence_span_ids":["ps_sec41","sd_2","sd_3","sd_6","sd_7","sd_9"],"heading":"总体设计","proposal_text":"本研究采用平行组、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机、多中心的总体设计，属于III期确证性研究，开发区域为中国。受试者按1:1随机分配至试验组或对照组，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂，每日一次口服，第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。匹配安慰剂与试验药物在外观和给药方式上匹配，以维持双盲。研究设计不计划样本量再估计，也不计划期中分析。整体研究时期包括筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周和安全性随访期4周。","rationale":"依据章节包4.1总体设计既有要素以及当前项目研究定义中总体设计、对照、给药方案、研究时期和不开展期中分析等事实。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7de17e9668663cc","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","evidence_span_ids":["ps_sec421","sd_3","sd_10","sd_11","sd_12"],"heading":"确证性设计与假设依据","proposal_text":"本研究的核心确证性比较为合成试验药A相较匹配安慰剂在第16周PASI 75应答率上的优效性。样本量假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，采用双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例，每组66例。主要分析采用全分析集，按随机分组以CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。研究不开展期中分析，也不进行样本量再估计。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中的样本量策略、估计目标策略、统计分析策略以及不开展期中分析和样本量再估计的事实。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_57a2ea891245f09c","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","evidence_span_ids":["ps_sec43","sd_2","sd_7","cc_rb"],"heading":"随机化","proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配，试验组与安慰剂组按1:1比例随机分配，随机化方式为随机分配，分配模型为平行组。随机化用于保证两组在已知和未知基线因素上的可比性，并支持主要终点在第16周的组间比较。为维护随机化实施的完整性，随机化方案和随机表应由独立于研究执行团队的人员生成，受试者按照预先产生的随机分配接受合成试验药A或匹配安慰剂。随机化资料和随机编号的管理应确保双盲状态不被破坏。","rationale":"依据章节包4.3既有正文、当前项目研究定义中随机化方式、1:1随机分配、平行组设计，以及公司参考语料中独立生成随机化方案和随机表的监管流程措辞。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_a72266096758d298","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143358_faf0354c","evidence_span_ids":["ps_sec44","sd_2","sd_6","cc_rb","cc_jm1","cc_jm2","cc_jm3","cc_jm4"],"heading":"盲法与揭盲","proposal_text":"本研究采用双盲设计，受试者、研究者、监查员以及数据分析人员等对受试者接受的是合成试验药A还是匹配安慰剂均不知情。匹配安慰剂用于维持双盲，双盲状态贯穿筛选期、双盲治疗期16周及安全性随访期4周。紧急情况下，如必须知道某一受试者的治疗分组以开展医疗处理，研究者可通过交互式网络应答系统（IWRS）发起紧急揭盲申请，填写揭盲原因并完成电子签名；IWRS系统将记录紧急揭盲人员、原因和时间，研究人员应详细记录紧急揭盲的理由、日期、处理情况、结果并签字。受试者被揭盲后将终止试验用药品治疗。常规揭盲应在数据经盲态核查、清理、确定统计分析集人群、数据冻结或数据库锁定后，由授权人员实施。","rationale":"依据章节包4.4既有双盲设计、当前项目研究定义中双盲和匹配安慰剂事实，以及公司参考语料中双盲维护、紧急揭盲和常规揭盲流程的监管措辞。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_818d6b6aa87464a2","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8361fb5148ff89d54c4860ed","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"37ca21cb154bef6e88ff357d1796c58412125030376ce377f8ec69e6524e1e07"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"8daf6dc46d42155e29ca2768fe326bcf20208390c0e565062d237a9768f12e59"},{"locator":"section:研究揭盲|block:464|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"1541424a072504b13dc999a7346751e32eebb848cc0771bb2ef3908b11c26ea0"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:356|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9dcf0050e6908f1bf1781d1b4e78bece680543f7bd3b6d430526c8fa0873ec33"},{"locator":"section:个例紧急揭盲|block:471|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"b1d5885b4afe4e5db3e8caef9a6db54129aefdb157084e23f8cc6b089099b16a"},{"locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:490|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"561c757e6967fae66f0f9d1043dba3e313bd0ee60a03f2c3c8da5efe892b0128"}]}